.alert.alert-light.border
  %h3.fw-semibold.mb-2 Goal of this page
  %p.mb-3
    See how clear Position / Title expectation blueprints are across the organization—so MAAP managers
    can find weak titles quickly and open them to fix path clarity and L1–L3 Position EAS.

  %h3.fw-semibold.mb-2 Context
  = render "shared/maap/definition"

  %h3.fw-semibold.mb-2 Specifics of this page
  %ul.mb-3
    %li
      The spotlight shows total titles and counts in each Expectation Alignment band (including Unscored).
    %li
      Each department (and Company-wide) has a bar of
      %strong titles
      ordered best → worst by Title Expectation Alignment Score.
    %li
      Click a segment to open that title and scroll to its Expectation Alignment Score.
    %li
      Use
      %strong Other actions → Refresh all
      to queue a Title EAS recalculation for every unarchived title (each refresh recalculates that title’s positions first). Prefer Refresh when many titles are unscored or after large MAAP edits—not on every page view.
